00:04:28.226 --> 00:04:30.061
- Same day. Same day.

00:04:30.061 --> 00:04:32.105
- So this all happened before the dunk contest?

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:32.897
- Before the dunk contest.

00:04:32.897 --> 00:04:35.108
I was sweating. I was like, "Damn, they stole my shoes"

00:04:35.108 --> 00:04:36.609
Then the next day, they found ‘em,

00:04:36.609 --> 00:04:37.902
