00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:41.531
And it was like, do not let nobody—so I gave ‘em to my mom.

00:04:41.531 --> 00:04:42.490
It was like, “Mom, here. Hold these.”

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.408
- [Laughing]

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:44.826
- “Don’t let nobody take my shoes.

00:04:44.826 --> 00:04:46.995
Just hold ‘em there with you.” So she put ‘em up,

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:49.330
and then we got to the dunk contest.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:50.290
- So, where the shoes at now?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.083
- Nike, they made me a dope-ass

00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:54.669
KryptoNate, heavy-ass box

00:04:54.669 --> 00:04:56.587
